* Race information and E-mail parameters for sending to AllSportRunning.com
*
* E-mail results to AllSportRunning.com
* Leave a space in front of "email to    results@AllSportRunning.com"  and
* until done testing.
* Edit the items at the bottom of this file according to your race.
* Edit line that emails to runscore to your own e-mail address and move to first column
* Edit "email from" to your e-mail address and move to first column
* Edit "email subject" to name of your race and move to first column
* Edit "email server" to your SMTP server and move to first column
* Run the listing and see if you get the results as a short e-mail plus an attachment
* of RSTMP$$$.txt
* When things work, move the "email to results@AllSportRunning.com" 
* over to the margin after testing
* Following for AllSportRunning
 email to            results@AllSportRunning.com
* Following for testing to mail to yourself.  Change to your e-mail address
 email to            your-email@example.com
 email from          your-email@example.com
 email subject       Vernon XX
 email server        smtp.example.com
